<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Structured Sparse Transition Matrices
<br class="ltx_break">to Enable State Tracking in State-Space Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
